---
import Shell from "../../../../src/astro/v2/Shell.astro";
import { progressFixture } from "../../lib/v2-learn.mjs";
---
<section class="learn-section" id="progress" aria-labelledby="learn-progress-title">
  <header class="learn-section-heading"><div><p class="hara-v2-kicker">Progress and learner profile</p><h2 id="learn-progress-title">Record meaningful learning facts, not attention metrics.</h2></div><p>Progress is account-scoped, revision-aware, and private by default. Completion evidence is controlled by the progress registry rather than editable front matter.</p></header>
  <Shell embedded={true} sidebar={false} aside={true} density="comfortable" mainId="learn-progress-dashboard" class="learn-progress-shell">
    <div class="learn-progress-main">
      <header><div><span>{progressFixture.contentType}@{progressFixture.schemaVersion}</span><h3>Learning profile</h3><p>{progressFixture.learner}</p></div><span class="learn-state" data-tone="muted">{progressFixture.visibility}</span></header>
      <div class="learn-progress-stats"><article><span>Completed units</span><strong>{progressFixture.completedUnits}</strong><small>Exact curriculum revision</small></article><article><span>Current unit</span><strong>{progressFixture.currentUnit}</strong><small>Recommended, not compulsory</small></article><article><span>Saved examples</span><strong>{progressFixture.savedExamples}</strong><small>Learner-owned</small></article><article><span>Private notes</span><strong>{progressFixture.privateNotes}</strong><small>Never public by default</small></article></div>
      <section class="learn-milestone-ledger"><header><span>Meaningful milestones</span><strong>{progressFixture.milestones.length} evidence-backed facts</strong></header><ol>{progressFixture.milestones.map((milestone, index) => <li data-state={milestone.state}><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><div><strong>{milestone.label}</strong><small>{milestone.evidence}</small></div><time>{milestone.date ?? "In progress"}</time><span class="learn-state" data-tone={milestone.state === "complete" ? "success" : "signal"}>{milestone.state}</span></li>)}</ol></section>
      <section class="learn-path-progress"><header><span>Path progress by revision</span><strong>No aggregate XP</strong></header><div>{progressFixture.pathProgress.map((path) => <article><div><strong>{path.track}</strong><span>{path.complete} / {path.total}</span></div><progress max={path.total} value={path.complete}>{path.complete} of {path.total}</progress><code>{path.revision}</code></article>)}</div></section>
      <section class="learn-saved-work"><header><span>Saved examples and notes</span><button type="button">Export my data</button></header><div><article><span class="learn-state" data-tone="muted">Private</span><strong>Namespace alias notes</strong><p>Two observations saved against lesson revision 4b7e1a62.</p><button type="button">Open note</button></article><article><span class="learn-state" data-tone="signal">Selected project</span><strong>Live signal field</strong><p>Private until an exact share link is created.</p><button type="button">Review visibility</button></article><article><span class="learn-state" data-tone="warning">Historical</span><strong>Typed schema exercise</strong><p>Completed against curriculum 1.3.0; current path uses 2.0.0.</p><button type="button">Inspect migration</button></article></div></section>
    </div>
    <aside slot="aside" class="learn-progress-inspector"><header><span>Progress authority</span><strong class="learn-mono">{progressFixture.curriculumRevision.split(":").at(-1)}</strong></header><dl><div><dt>Learner</dt><dd>{progressFixture.learner}</dd></div><div><dt>Curriculum</dt><dd class="learn-mono">{progressFixture.curriculumRevision}</dd></div><div><dt>Visibility</dt><dd>{progressFixture.visibility}</dd></div><div><dt>Completion control</dt><dd>Progress registry</dd></div></dl><section><span>Privacy controls</span>{progressFixture.privacyControls.map((control) => <label><input type="checkbox" checked={control !== "Share selected projects"} /> {control}</label>)}</section><section class="learn-excluded-mechanics"><span>Deliberately absent</span>{progressFixture.excludedMechanics.map((mechanic) => <code>{mechanic}</code>)}</section><p>Identity becomes useful after meaningful activity; it never blocks execution or transfers progress into World.</p></aside>
  </Shell>
</section>
